# Program timeline

Each initiative's planned days on the sprint axis, with each release at the end of its sprint. Done, active, and future items are drawn as such; each initiative's own page draws its epics, features, and stories.

```mermaid
---
config:
  gantt:
    leftPadding: 97
---
gantt
    title Initiatives
    dateFormat YYYY-MM-DD
    axisFormat %G-W%V
    tickInterval 1week
    weekday monday
    section Releases
    Release 01.0 :milestone, t_release_01_0, 2026-11-06, 0d
    Release 01.1 :milestone, t_release_01_1, 2026-11-27, 0d
    Release 01.2 :milestone, t_release_01_2, 2026-12-18, 0d
    section Initiatives
    in001-reliable-agents Reliable agents :active, t_in001_reliable_agents, 2026-10-19, 2026-12-19
```

The [interactive timeline](program.html) draws every item, with the plan as it stood at each corpus tag to compare.

